sentences.text:
Learned counsel further submits that "appointment orders"
do not fall within the definition of "valuable security" as prescribed in section 30 of IPC and therefore, section 467 of IPC does not get attracted in the present crime;
further, section 467 of IPC is only added to defeat the benefit of section 41A of Cr.P.C., procedure to the Petitioner; Petitioner is suffering from breast lump and from the last four years, she has been taking treatment; the entire investigation is completed except the filing of charge sheet; Petitioner is a housewife and she is having permanent abode at Hyderabad.
